{"id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-set-theoretic-background.md","title":"Set-Theoretic Background","display":"Set-Theoretic Background","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","aliases":["93-df-set-theoretic-background"],"display":"Set-Theoretic Background","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-set-theoretic-background"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-set-theoretic-background</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Set-Theoretic Background"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-set-theoretic-background---Set-Theoretic-Background\">df-set-theoretic-background - Set-Theoretic Background</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is the ambient universe of sets and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is its standard set of natural numbers.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f\\in V\\)</span>; a natural number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> is identified with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\)</span> are the local predicates defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The assertions are separated so that an object-valued definition is never joined to another definition by propositional conjunction. Function application is used only after <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\\)</span> supplies a unique graph value.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-set-theoretic-background---Set-Theoretic-Background","text":"df-set-theoretic-background - Set-Theoretic Background","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":1757,"backlinks":[{"id":"0838691d607f25ab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]."},{"id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$X,Y\\in V$ are sets and $\\mathrm{Set}_{93}$ is the set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]."},{"id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"68f061fdc82867b9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · 